{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14385","headline":"哭长孙侍郎 · 杜诵","name":"哭长孙侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道爲诗书重，名因赋颂雄。\n礼闱曾擢桂，宪府既乘骢。\n流水生涯尽，浮云世事空。\n唯余旧台柏，萧瑟九原中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜诵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}